  "critique": {
    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The provocative “Accuracy is the wrong question.” headline and evaluation-ledger styling give the screen a recognizable editorial frame across viewports. However, most of the experience resolves into familiar dark dashboard cards, standard charts, KPI tiles, and a data table; the cyan/red palette and monospace labels alone do not create a singular demo moment.",
